  "tolerance": "Measured block: vessel state volume closure to 1e-12 relative; energy balance residual to 6e-4 of initial internal energy, the acceptance this tool’s manifest records; discharge relation to the 1e-12*max(1,mdot) break test of discharge(); partition refinement to the previous step-to-step change or to the dtMax*2^-24 floor of the 24-bisection event localisation; time-scaling invariants to the 2e-8 pairwise spread the manifest records. Observed on the adiabatic orifice case: energy residual 2.010e-12 of initial U. Observed on the pipe case: the resistance relation closes to 2.550e-15 kg/s against its 1e-12*max(1,mdot) test. The equilibrium two-phase terminal time moves 2.075e-4 s under a halving of dtMax against 6.811e-4 s for the halving before it. Recorded block: tolerances as published on 2026-09-05.",
